{"214b0cbbb1540673"
 {:text
  "Need a whole project? The studio's Mac mini builds it on the shared database while you keep working.",
  :seconds 6.113},
 "2a248d043f075888"
 {:text
  "Describe a shot in plain words and get the frames. Like one? Find more like it.",
  :seconds 5.642},
 "5bfc004f4da848c1"
 {:text
  "B-roll, logged shot by shot. Close-ups, pans, the best moment starred, the shaky ones left out.",
  :seconds 7.889},
 "6eaa8355aa2511a3"
 {:text "New in version 0.1.19: scrub every card.", :seconds 5.146},
 "8536408f509e5a99"
 {:text
  "Find what was said. Any word, in English or Italian, across every transcript. Then read around the hit.",
  :seconds 8.124},
 "a611f3e3e2f9abd1"
 {:text
  "Ask for a rough cut and it plays seconds later. Every edit is kept, so you can always go back.",
  :seconds 6.609},
 "ad1188b354b088c3"
 {:text
  "It all lives on your Mac already: transcripts, proxies and picture search, brought down by Dropbox. Fast, and the NAS is never touched.",
  :seconds 10.031},
 "b5e367e65b254f24"
 {:text
  "Online it: back to the camera originals, with handles, and every recorder synced underneath.",
  :seconds 6.269},
 "b86f575f1edfe17a"
 {:text
  "This is Black Box. Every clip, every word, every frame, every face. You ask in plain words. Your agent does the rest.",
  :seconds 10.188},
 "c55f36933b66060d"
 {:text
  "Search by person: who's talking, who's on screen, and in how many clips.",
  :seconds 5.721},
 "ee646e730511565f"
 {:text
  "Selects on a page. Hover to preview, click to read along. S selects, I imports them into Resolve.",
  :seconds 8.594},
 "f62fc0406604cf31"
 {:text
  "Stills for print and the web, rendered full size from the originals, in the house look or yours.",
  :seconds 6.348},
 "fb45dfbfc96548ae"
 {:text
  "A screenshot from a client? Black Box finds the clip, and the exact moment, it came from.",
  :seconds 6.113},
 "fe66302d76c212c4"
 {:text
